# Tritonian Scientist

## Lore

This researcher and explorer is interested in the secrets of the sea and in the preservation of Tritonia, and must be willing to pick up a laser and defend his home, follow a team of Sea Wolves into the depths after an ancient artifact, or investigate a supernatural occurrence. Scientists specialise in one field, but because they may be called on to deal with anything, they carry a working knowledge of several others - particularly if assigned to a mini-sub for deep-sea exploring.

Like all Tritonian citizens they undergo basic military training in their teens. Those who score highly on scholastic aptitude tests are selected for higher education and exposed to several scientific disciplines until they settle on one. Six years of intensive study are followed by a year of internships, during which the budding scientist also picks up mechanical and electronic trades. The goal is a well-rounded scholar who can fix a broken vehicle as well as understand the mysteries of life.

## GM Notes

Scientists are given a great deal of respect by every Tritonian citizen. Many end up on the Board of Representatives or become Administrators. They are the lifeblood of the drifting colony and they know it, which makes a few of them overbearing and arrogant - though most are hard-working, dedicated and relatively humble, accepting their accolades with good grace and understanding the responsibility that comes with them.

In the danger-ridden oceans of Rifts Earth, a researcher is in as much danger as any adventurer.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'tritonian-scientist');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'tritonian-scientist';
SELECT count(*) AS stub_gear FROM gear WHERE slug IN ('hand-computer', 'electronic-notebook', 'science-kit', 'bg-15-blue-green-laser-pistol', 'scuba-body-armor');

